Description: Provides World input-output (year 2000) and Brazilian input-output (year 2020) data for R. Data were made available by Dr. Celso Bissoli Sessa and the Center for Computational Studies in General Equilibrium (CECEG) from the Department of Economics at the Federal University of Espírito Santo (UFES), Brazil.
